{
  "type": "doc",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Nosdesk is a helpdesk with a knowledge base built in. It tracks support tickets, groups work into projects and cycles, and keeps a record of the devices you support. Documentation lives here too, including the page you are reading."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2,
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Start here"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Tickets are where most of the work happens. Incoming email becomes a ticket, and your replies go back to the requester. See "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "https://nosdesk.com/docs/guide/ticket-queue",
                "title": null
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "working the ticket queue"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "For a tour of the sidebar, search, and your dashboard, read "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "https://nosdesk.com/docs/guide/getting-around",
                "title": null
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "finding your way around"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Notifications cover mentions, assignments, and SLA breaches, and you choose which of them interrupt you. See "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "https://nosdesk.com/docs/guide/notifications",
                "title": null
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "notifications and mentions"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2,
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Documentation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You are reading a page in the Getting Started collection. Pages live in collections, and a page can belong to more than one."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "attrs": {
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "ychange": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "ychange": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Add a page with the + button in the sidebar, and drag pages to nest them"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "ychange": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "ychange": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Type "
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "code"
                    }
                  ],
                  "text": "/"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " in the editor for formatting commands, and "
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "code"
                    }
                  ],
                  "text": "@"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " to mention a teammate"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "ychange": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "ychange": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Several people can edit a page at once, and everyone sees the changes as they happen"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "ychange": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "ychange": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Paste a ticket URL into a page to link it to that ticket"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "ychange": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "ychange": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Collection visibility controls which groups can read a collection"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "More in "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "https://nosdesk.com/docs/guide/knowledge-base",
                "title": null
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "writing and sharing documentation"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2,
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Projects and assets"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Projects and cycles group work over time. See "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "https://nosdesk.com/docs/guide/projects-and-cycles",
                "title": null
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "projects and cycles"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Assets track the devices you support and connect them to the tickets about them. See "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "https://nosdesk.com/docs/guide/assets-and-devices",
                "title": null
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "assets and devices"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2,
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "For administrators"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Email, authentication, SLA policies, and workspace settings are under Settings. The "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "https://nosdesk.com/docs/operations/configuration",
                "title": null
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "configuration guide"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " walks through the options."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "ychange": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Full documentation lives at "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "https://nosdesk.com/docs",
                "title": null
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "nosdesk.com/docs"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
